Use case Description
-
1. View Policy Details
As a policyholder, I want to view my policy number, coverage type, coverage value, inclusions and exclusions 
so that I know what my insurance covers.

-
2. Manage Claims (add/update/delete)
As a policyholder, I want to add/update/delete a new car insurance claim online so that I do not need to
lodge it manually.

